From: Andrew Tridgell <andrew@tridgell.net>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:41:34 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] native: WebSplat entry: SIFT, mapping checkpoints and
 exact resume

- ws_sift: COLMAP SIFT (VLFeat CPU, FeatureExtractionOptions defaults) on
  an 8-bit grey image in memory
- ws_m_state / ws_prng_get / ws_prng_set: poses, camera and PRNG after a
  round, for checkpoints; ws_m_prepare(digits, params) resumes from them
- every round after the first starts from a model rebuilt from its own
  poses and camera, so a round depends only on what a checkpoint stores
